      "TEXT": "Avonia Message A",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Avonia Witch-Hunter \n\u0022Not you! The last time we saw your kind, war broke out!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Avonia Message B",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Avonia Witch-Hunter \n\u0022Orcs have taken over the lowlands!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Avonia Message C",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Avonia Witch-Hunter \n\u0022With the aid of an outsider, the Barbarians have conquered the high lands!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Aragonia Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Aragonia citizen \n\u0022Long ago, the Empire attempted to settle the region... They twice failed to establish themselves. We know that the first colony wanted to return to the Empire; as a result, they were branded as rebels and slain by their own people!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Edras",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Squire \n\u0022We first arrived here to mine the land and extract all of its wealth, for this land is rich in gold and gems. Before the outsider came, peace did reign  supreme... Then, he tired of his people and decided that this was where he would settle!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Winning Event 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Winning Event 3",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Forest Keep Text",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": " \n\u0022A violent tribe nearby lives under the leadership of one who is from another land... We know little of this mysterious leader, and nobody that we have sent to inquire has ever returned!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spear man says leave",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman  \n\u0022I have claimed this territory, intruder! Leave now... To live among the wolves and spiders!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Avonia Says Leave",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Avonia Witch-Hunter \n\u0022We will never allow you to enter our city! Should you try, you\u0027ll have a frightful battle upon your hands!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mountain Clans Day One",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bragon the strong \n\u0022Long ago, the Empire tried to establish a colony here. The settlers left, against the Empire\u0027s orders, but never made it home... A second colony was sent and they too vanished!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MClans Day Ten",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hill Giant \n\u0022There is something familiar here - I don\u0027t know what exactly... Something, or someone, in this territory is very familiar!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Day One",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Beliarh \n\u0022Human bones are scattered across the land; the Empire must have been here at one time... There is no sign of their forces now, only their bones remain to speak of their failure!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Day 12",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Baroness \n\u0022The bones of the Empire forces are everywhere... Legend speaks of a tribe and their outlander leader protecting this region. I suspect that the Empire met this tribe, their bones tell the tale of their fate!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Undead Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Skeleton \n\u0022My master there are mounted skeletons that mark the land. These markings have been scorched by lightning! Powerful forces must protect the region. Regardless these unseen protectors will bow down to the Undead Hordes.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Undead Fourteen",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ghost \n\u0022I sense restless spirits here... They were slaughtered by their own people - Empire forces. They want to warn us of others who remain! An outsider with the power to control lightning roams these lands!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Barbarian Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Barbarian Warrior \n\u0022He who commands the elements wishes you to leave! Retreat - or be destroyed!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc leave our land",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Barbarian Chieftain \n\u0022Leave our land now, and forevermore! If you do not go of your own free will you will be forced... My master controls the forces of lightning, and has the power to strike you down! That is, if I do not defeat you first!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mclans Day 1b",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The mountain Tower has been taken over by Orcs! A pair of magical boots, which have proven useful in the past, are hidden at the top of the tower. We do not know how many enemies you will meet, should you try to regain the boots!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0000",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Furren\u0027s Shop",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0000",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "How may I help you stranger?",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0001",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Under\u0027s Shop",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0001",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "My items are the best in the realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0002",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Luggen\u0027s Camp",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0002",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "My mercenaries will join your army ... for a price.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0003",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Xennon\u0027s Camp",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0003",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "My Berzerkers have been trained to obey.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0004",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Malavien\u0027s Tower",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0004",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "My spells are the most potent in the region.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0005",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Metaca\u0027s Camp",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S207SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S207SI0005",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "I will train your units for a price.",
